WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.000
JUDAU'S DECISION

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:50.600
You're the one? The man who
brought this unsightly mobile suit here?

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.350
Well, excuse me!

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.560
What is it, then?
What's your business here?

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:58.020
I, Gemon Bajack, have come
to offer you my assistance.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.360
I'll defeat the Zeta Gundam
with this Geze.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:05.570
After that, you can do
as you like to the Argama.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:08.660
I work as a junk
dealer in this colony,

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.660
and I built the Geze myself.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.080
My skills are unquestionable!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.410
A junk dealer in this colony?

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:16.370
I've been a fan of you guys...

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:20.540
ever since I heard about
how Axis hit the Gate of Zedan.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.460
I like people who
do things in a big way.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.850
Is that clear, Mashymre?

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:35.600
It's vital that you win the cooperation
of those who live in the colony.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:40.560
It will make our job easier.
Keep that in mind.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:45.110
That's right...
This man is a citizen of this colony.

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:47.450
Very well.
I accept your offer.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.870
This is gonna be fun!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.790
Are you sure we
should trust this guy, sir?

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:02.380
Let me be clear: we need to befriend
the inhabitants of this colony.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.760
That was Lady Haman's intention.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.760
Lady Haman, again?

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.180
I'll ask you not to speak
of her in that tone!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.090
Gemon!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.180
Yeah?

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:14.060
I'd like to discuss this with you.
Come with me to the bridge.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.270
Before that, I want you
to hear my conditions.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.350
What?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:22.980
I want your mobile suits to
back me up when I attack.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.650
Backup? Very well.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.790
But I don't want
to be a pilot cadet!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.080
Captain Bright also
recognizes how good you are.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.870
You've got potential!

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:42.250
I've seen all sorts of pilots,
but you're really good!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.750
Now look...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.710
If you'll let us use the Argama
as our base, I'll go with you.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.550
In that case, I'll go with you!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:50.680
And me.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.800
I'm kind of interested
too, Judau.

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.350
The Argama isn't
an amusement park!

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.270
Then we have
nothing to discuss.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.810
Big Brother, if you become a
pilot cadet instead of a junk dealer,

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.230
you'll get some order in your life.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.400
As for your schooling, the people
on the Argama could--

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.030
Knock it off! If I want to
learn stuff, I'll go to school!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:10.360
Let's go!

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.570
Wait, Judau!

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.280
I'm going, too!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.580
Big Brother, where are you going?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.950
To school, so I can learn!

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.250
So contrary!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.710
- Qum! C'mon!
- Yeah!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.080
Shinta! Qum!
You'll get lost!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.420
Miss Fa.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.380
I promise
I'll convince my brother.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:32.300
So please tell the people on the
Argama not to give up on him!

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.140
Are they launching a
serious attack this time?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.560
- Hey! What are you doing?!
- Crap!

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.570
Hold it!
One move, and I'll shoot!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.530
What's the big idea?!

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.440
I've been waiting
here for an hour!

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.870
Even if they're only there as escorts,
if I send out two Gaza-Cs...

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.870
what will the citizens
of Shangri-La think of us?

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:02.210
Will they get a bad
impression of Axis?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.380
That could end up harming
Lady Haman's good name.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.180
My beloved Lady Haman.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.020
Before you, I am but a poor,
lost lamb, seeking your help.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:23.640
I beg you. Please grant this lamb
your wisdom and courage!

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.560
I beg of you, Lady Haman.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:30.280
Oh, Lady Haman.
Lady Haman! Lady Haman!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.580
Gottn, reporting, sir!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.870
You...!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.460
You didn't see anything!

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.790
You're choking me!
I saw nothing! I heard nothing!

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.670
I didn't hear anything
about being a lamb!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:49.460
What?!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.670
Um, I didn't say anything!
You must have misheard me, sir!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:57.550
Good. You understand
how things work.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:01.970
Once this operation is complete,
I'll give you a week's leave.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.180
Sir! Thank you, sir!

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.850
By the way,
what did you come for?

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.980
Yes, sir! Our attack
preparations are complete.

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:12.570
Is that all?

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:13.690
Sir!

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.070
I see.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.160
Gemon, we're ready to launch.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:25.660
That's MASTER Gemon to you!
You're my subordinate!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:26.670
What?!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.670
Gottn, do as Gemon says.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:32.050
Master Mashymre?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:32.920
Roger.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.050
Two subordinates, huh?

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.090
I'm heading out,
Boss Mashymre!

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:50.150
You don't overtake
your commander!

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.770
I'll have you fired for this!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.950
Hey, some mobile suits are
launching from that ship in port.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.160
What do you mean?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.660
They're after the Argama.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:08.750
Miss Fa!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.380
Is your brother home?

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.040
They all went to school.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.750
Did the weather make
everyone go crazy?!

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.340
Search me. The Colony
Corporation is just lazy.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.260
They keep it like
springtime all year round.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:22.050
- I need this.
- Hey, wait!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.720
Thief!

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.350
They really went to school?!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.270
We'll know when we get there!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:36.650
Helen Allen.

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:37.860
Here.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:38.950
Mike Bilmore.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:39.900
Here.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:41.110
Johnny Uematsu.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.280
Here!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.330
Erma Gamma?

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.120
Here!

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:47.250
Teacher!
You skipped my name!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.870
Judau Ashta?
What are you doing here?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:54.250
Compulsory education
applies to everyone, right?

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:55.300
- Yo!
- Ow!

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:03.760
He only just got here, and now...!
He's making a fool of me!

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.450
OW!!!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.070
What's that?

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:25.620
Dunno, but when
you push it like this,

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.240
white powder comes out.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.460
Wow, that looks fun!
Can I try it?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.870
There's a ton of them
over there. Go get one.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.670
'Kay!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.090
What are they up to?

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:48.890
Follow me!

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:49.970
'Kay!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.980
And...turn!

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.780
Judau Ashta.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.870
Uh, yes?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.080
Try to solve this problem!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.870
Seriously?

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.700
Of course!

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:10.700
Aw, man...

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.910
- NOW!
- Okay!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.370
What?

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.460
Where are Judau and the others?

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.420
Studying,
like they should be!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.760
Judau, we've got trouble!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:27.220
Whuzzat...?

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.350
What's up, Elle?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:32.770
Three mobile suits are
attacking the Argama!

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:33.980
What?

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.450
Didn't I tell you to stop
getting in front of me?!

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.450
What... What's that?

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:54.580
Z-G...?

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:57.880
The Zeta Gundam?!
Why, that...!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.420
Gemon... sir...
What are you doing?

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:06.970
Don't you see those letters?!
It's a challenge from the Zeta!

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:08.180
A challenge?

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.950
Dammit, Elle!
What did you mean, the Argama?

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.870
They're attacking this school!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:40.670
Um... Um... I am
Mr. Gemon Bajack, the junk dealer!

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:44.380
I am hereby challenging the Zeta!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:47.510
Face me, or else
I'll smash this school!

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.680
Do you have a bad case of
cowardice, Zeta Gundam?

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.260
Face me now!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.560
Face me, or else I'll kill
every teacher and student here!

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.560
I know you're nearby!

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:01.560
If you don't face me,
I swear I'll smash this school!

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:05.490
One of my finer qualities
is that I never lie, Zeta!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.910
Someone shut that idiot up.
He's giving me a headache!

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.370
Captain, it's Fa!
Fa's back!

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:15.160
Don't wimp out, or you're really
gonna end up getting stomped!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.410
Everyone, give me a hand!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.250
W-What do you mean,
give you a hand?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.380
I don't want to!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:22.250
I'm scared!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.050
My mom told me to
never do anything dangerous.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.170
Judau!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.760
What do we do? Run for it?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.970
There's no time for that!

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.890
If you don't face me,
I'll kill every student!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:40.480
Wasn't the plan to attack the Argama?

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.400
I hope things work on
Beecha and Iino's end.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.700
Okay! Let's do it!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.660
Ready, set...

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:57.370
What?!

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:59.460
You actually think you're cool?

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.620
Maybe you can take
lessons from a Hizack or something!

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.560
There are better
mobile suits than a Hizack!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.690
My Geze has the mobility
of a combat mobile suit!

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.940
- Sorry for the wait!
- I developed it myself!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.230
Sure, those stubby legs
look REAL mobile!

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.650
Can it even run?!

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:29.360
Even if you are just kids,
I won't take that lying down!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.030
Stubby legs! No waist!
Stumbles all over the place!

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:37.330
Little brats!

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.620
Go, Elle!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.630
What the...?!

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.840
We did it!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.350
Yay!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.470
- Yo!
- We did it!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.480
You brats!

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.230
Unforgivable!

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:05.360
I have to recoup the cash
I spent building this mobile suit.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.900
Rise, my Geze!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.820
I will never forgive anyone
who makes fun of my Geze!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:17.530
I don't care if your parents come
and apologize to me!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.870
No time to admire it!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.250
Whoa! He smashed
the door to the stairs!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.340
Not bad!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.550
You don't mess with adults!

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:37.470
I'm taking you hostage
till the Zeta shows up!

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.100
Zeta Gundam, ready to launch!

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.810
Keep your head down as
low as you can when you go!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.230
Roger!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:53.400
Fa, if you meet up with Judau,
have him use the Zeta!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.450
If I can,
I'll handle this by myself.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.450
I suppose.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.450
Zeta Gundam, moving out!

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.090
Leina...!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.340
Zeta Gundam!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.880
Zeta Gundam!

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.340
Zeta Gundam!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.720
I don't suppose it's
that easy to call it, huh?

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.300
I know how they feel,
but yelling for it won't work!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.640
It's coming!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.600
Zeta Gundam's coming!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:29.150
At last, it's come!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.940
Zeta Gundam!
You think you're too good for me?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.490
Leave this to him!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.780
It'll look bad to the people here
if they see Gaza-Cs fighting, too!

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:42.700
Hurry! Hurry!
Agh!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.210
Zeta Gundam!
Where are you going?!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.870
I have hostages!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:52.500
If you really want to beat the Zeta,
then come to me where we can fight!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:55.300
Trying to lure me by
showing me your backside?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:08.690
How kind of you to avoid getting
the kids caught in the fight.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:11.110
You live here too, don't you?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:12.690
How can you involve
children in this?!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.860
Wait! Hey!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:20.030
If you use that launcher here,
you'll cause more than just an annoyance!

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.200
What? That's right.
We're inside a colony.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.080
Gemon, that was a dirty trick!

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.920
Now the hatch won't close!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.710
You're not as good
as I've heard, Zeta!

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:39.010
It takes more than
that to wreck this!

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.890
Not bad.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.810
The cockpit moves?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.100
The pilot's a woman?!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.230
That pilot's indecisive.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:58.650
Gas tanks...

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.070
Judau!

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:04.410
Beecha! Knock down
that gas tank! Help them!

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:04.950
Huh?!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.790
- Just accept it, girl!
- Not yet!

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:18.590
Damn it! The river!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.760
The Zeta's coming back!

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.930
Should we really
be doing this?

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:32.650
It's okay. These tanks are
to be dismantled, anyway.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.980
This'll pull it off!

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:37.480
Judau! Ready to go!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:42.950
Just do what I say
and be mine, Zeta!

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.240
How dare you say that
when I have to hold back...

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.660
in case I use too much
power in combat!

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:50.120
Oh, you don't say?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:17:00.590
There must be an insulation failure
somewhere... How could this...?

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.630
I have you!

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.140
Hey, you rusty mobile suit!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:08.260
What's so fun about
beating up a broken Zeta?

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.640
You again?!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.140
Come and get me!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.610
Now, Beecha!
Your direction is perfect!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:16.860
Okay!

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.160
Why are you following me?!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.750
Here it comes!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.170
What?!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.880
What's that?!

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.810
Now's my chance!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:55.100
I get it. This is a
gas tank. In that case...!

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:04.320
How do you like that, gas tank?!

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.530
That kid!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.000
Miss Fa? Are you okay?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.160
Judau...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.000
Behind us!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.500
He's still coming!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.590
Quit it!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:31.890
I don't care if you're a civilian!
Don't mess with the Zeta!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:35.100
Hey! I'm still...!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:40.110
I'll smash you and
that little smart-ass!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.190
Miss Fa! I'm here, too!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:51.780
Judau!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.450
Get it together, Miss Fa!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:56.660
Why, you...!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:06.720
Miss Fa, get out now!
Hurry!

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:07.880
I can still fight!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.220
Would you prefer to be my seat?!

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:10.760
No!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:18.980
Judau, if you use the Zeta on full blast,
you'll destroy the colony!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:19.980
Gotcha!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.980
Whoops. Sorry!

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.690
Couldn't you set me down?!

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.940
Quit complaining
and get away from here!

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:28.990
Right!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.420
He's fast!

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.000
Do you see the power
of a movable cockpit?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.210
Hardly!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.210
Now it's my turn!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:55.640
Well? Are you beaten?

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.230
Wha...?

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:06.400
I feel dizzy...

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.860
GOTCHA!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.790
It won't stop!

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:24.380
You reap what you sow.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.710
Stay in there a while and reflect
on your wrongdoings.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.380
Please, make it stop!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.010
I was just doing
what I was asked to!

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:33.390
Don't con me!

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.560
It's true! The boss
of some ship in port...

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.390
called the Endra
asked me to do it!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:40.480
The Endra?

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.610
I'm saved!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.610
Was he a really pretentious
guy with a red rose on his chest?

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:50.900
Yeah!
You know him really well, sir!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.530
Mashymre Cello of Axis.

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:57.120
He threatened me and
forced me to fight you!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:59.370
Please forgive me.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.790
I see.
It was him, again.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.330
This was unforgivable,
Mashymre Cello!

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:08.090
As I thought! I never should have
left this to that junk dealer!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.880
Now the Endra will have to
attack the Argama directly!

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:14.800
But we'd end up
terrifying the citizens here!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:18.180
We'd lose the point of our not
participating in this last battle!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:20.220
That's true.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.890
How could I lose sight
of something so important?

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:24.600
I'm tired.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.610
That's right.
Fatigue clouds your judgment.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:32.240
If you're hasty, you may end up turning
the local citizens into your enemies.

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:34.780
I earnestly hope you'll
be careful of that, Mashymre.

00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:37.490
It's just as she said.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:40.700
Why don't you wait for the
new prototypes to be assembled?

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:45.710
We still have some mobile suits
aboard that need to be tested.

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.790
That's right.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.090
The Hamma-Hamma
among them. Yes...

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:55.260
Oh, Lady Haman.
Give me strength.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.550
Since we don't know
when they'll attack next,

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:00.720
I'll hang on to the Zeta Gundam.

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:03.890
Then you may as well
all come to the Argama.

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:06.100
I already said no.

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:10.400
But Judau, where will you
keep the Zeta Gundam?

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:14.110
That's right. I don't have any
place to store a mobile suit.

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:17.910
And there's no way you can
hide something that big, right?

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:21.330
The crane rental for servicing it
is gonna be a killer!

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:24.370
Exactly. But you can use
the ones on the Argama for free.

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:26.920
Oh, well. Guess I'll bring
it back to the Argama, then.

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:29.590
Okay, then can you fly it back
without wrecking the place?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.250
Sure. I'll try not to.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:49.520
The Endra's new mobile suit
Zssa is a new model,

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:51.610
which means it's powerful!

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:53.980
It really throws a
wrench into our plans!

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:57.740
Business is looking bad, and
somehow people have the impression...

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.200
that we're now crew
aboard the Argama.

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:05.040
On the bright side, that money-grubbing
Mr. Damar's house has a really bad day.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:08.500
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Zssa Menace."

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:09.710
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:12.850
Next Time

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:12.850
THE ZSSA MENACE

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:12.250
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!
